Z||000000||Oreif||04-13-2001||06:21 PM||||I picked up my hood from the paint shop!<BR>With the assistance of GT GT 87, (Big Thanks!!) We were able to get the hood installed. The picks look a little bad since the car was in the garage and I cranked up the brightness to see the details better. Once the stereo system is done I'll wash the car and take outside pics. Note: To those wanting vents, We had to lower the coolant overflow tank and some minor height adjustment on the lip if the front trunk for fit. (amazing what you can align with a B.F.H. !   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>So how does it look?<P>(anyone need a hood and headlight covers in gloss black? I got a spares)<P><BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Hood_4.jpg">  <P><BR>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 04-13-2001).]||||reg||1
