Z||000004||Oreif||04-13-2001||10:30 PM||||Start over?!? Geez, I would hate to redo all the work I've put in this one. All that's left is the 3.4L conversion which is a few years away.<BR>The Total cost to do the hood was about $650.<BR>That includes the cost of the hood, supplies, and having the body shop do the final finish and paint (and some minor repair to a corner  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/redface.gif">  ) . The design is simular to Archie's but we canted the sides to more of a slope rather than straight down.<BR>The actual design was done by Coyote. <BR>To have the hood painted was the most expensive. Total hours was about 20.<BR><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg"> ||||reg||1
